    broker pool limit 10 
    worker pool  solo  
    worker prefetch multiplier 0 
    task default delivery mode 1 
    task queues  
         bench worker    
             exchange    bench worker  
             routing key    bench worker ack exchange durable queue durable auto delete task serializer  json  
    task default queue  bench worker  
    result backend tdiff time monotonic app task cur 0  time start queue  bench worker   bare n cur i % 5000 
